{'symbol': 'FTNT', 'date': '2022-03-24 10:00:00', 'title': 'SPECTROTEL AWARDED A 2022 INTERNET TELEPHONY SD-WAN PRODUCT OF THE YEAR AWARD', 'text': "SPECTROTEL'S SECURE SD-WAN RECOGNIZED FOR EXCEPTIONAL INNOVATION NEPTUNE, N.J., MARCH 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SPECTROTEL, INC.,\xa0A NEXT-GENERATION AGGREGATOR AND LEADING INTEGRATED COMMUNICATION SERVICES PROVIDER, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS SECURE SD-WAN SERVICE\xa0WITH GATEWAYS, POWERED BY FORTINET ® (NASDAQ: FTNT), A GARTNER MAGIC QUADRANT AND GLOBAL LEADER, HAS BEEN AWARDED A 2022 INTERNET TELEPHONY SD-WAN PRODUCT OF THE YEAR AWARD BY TMC,\xa0A GLOBAL, INTEGRATED MEDIA COMPANY."}